  "RightSideDisplay": 10,
  "RightSideHtmlBlock": "<h4>Outage impact (Business Impact Analysis)</h4><p>Rate the impact on the organization if the mission/business processes affected in this move could not be performed. Name the processes in the comments.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><th>Cost (template example)</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Severe</td><td>e.g. temp staffing, overtime, fees greater than $1 million</td></tr><tr><td>Moderate</td><td>e.g. fines, penalties, liabilities, potential $550k</td></tr><tr><td>Minimal</td><td>e.g. new contracts, supplies, $75k</td></tr></table><p>The thresholds are the BIA template's sample values; your organization should set its own.</p><p><i>Source: NIST SP 800-34 Rev. 1, Contingency Planning Guide for Federal Information Systems (2010), Section 3.2 and Appendix B (BIA template).</i></p>",
